SARP AI Pro
RELEASE PACKAGE INTEGRITY VERIFICATION
SHA-256 CHECKSUM

This document explains how to verify the downloaded SARP AI Pro setup
archive before extracting or installing it.

Release package:
SARP_AI_Pro_6_Setup.zip

Hash algorithm:
SHA-256

Published checksum:
820478224b1c9865f6078167d38e0ee782b0a99fb4b12d2ca8a8f4c8cd76bc51


HOW TO VERIFY ON WINDOWS

1. Download SARP_AI_Pro_6_Setup.zip.
2. Open the folder containing the ZIP file.
3. Click the File Explorer address bar, type powershell, and press Enter.
4. Run this command:

   Get-FileHash ".\SARP_AI_Pro_6_Setup.zip" -Algorithm SHA256

5. Compare the Hash value returned by Windows with the published checksum
   shown in this document.

HOW TO READ THE RESULT

- MATCH: If both SHA-256 values are identical, the ZIP archive matches the
  published checksum.
- NO MATCH: If the values differ, the archive is not identical to the file
  represented by this checksum. Do not install it as a verified release.
  Download the package again from the official SARP AI Pro source and check
  it again.

IMPORTANT SECURITY NOTE

A matching SHA-256 checksum confirms that the downloaded archive matches
the published checksum. It does not, by itself, prove the identity of the
publisher or guarantee that the software is safe. For stronger publisher
verification, the release should also be digitally signed with a trusted
code-signing certificate.

Product:
SARP AI Pro
Digital Intelligence System for Higher Education

Keep this document with the release package. Whenever the ZIP archive is
updated or replaced, calculate and publish a new SHA-256 checksum.
